{
  "uid": "jithendar-com-overview",
  "title": "Jithendar.com \u00b7 Overview",
  "description": "Traffic, errors and latency (from Next.js server spans), site figures and runtime for jithendar.com. Metrics: http://<pod>:9464/metrics (jithendar.com repo, www/src/lib/metrics.ts). Health probes (/api/health) are left out of request panels.",
